    },
    {
        "text": "I know that in my body is a fire. If I feel for it, I can feel it burning me. After so long, the pain of it comes to me even before my thoughts do."
    },
    {
        "text": "Our parents warned us to take these flames we were born with and swallow them down, hide them away, and never let them be seen by anyone."
    },
    {
        "text": "But I knew\u2014how my sister would secretly burn whatever she didn't want, and then she'd get something better for it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I do that too?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad, can you take me to the bookshop?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That morning, I thought I'd try acting like her, talking to my parents in her tone of voice."
    },
    {
        "text": "Every time she told them what she wanted, they'd agree with panic, like they were being burnt, yet with love."
    },
    {
        "text": "She and I had the same appearance and voice, and wore the same clothes, so why couldn't I disguise myself as her?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to read the sequel to the Steam Knights adventures... since\u2014I don't want anyone asking me, how come a Victorian wouldn't like stories about the Steam Knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Tomorrow, Loughshinny. Your mum and dad are exhausted for today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad... did you recognize me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. How could I ever mix up my own two daughters?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
