    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I only realized, after that snowy night, that he didn't say yes\u2014because what I wanted was far too small."
    },
    {
        "text": "She wouldn't have gone begging to our parents, just for a new book."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
