    {
        "text": "I followed behind her, running as fast as I could."
    },
    {
        "text": "The bells to reunite sounded\u2014yet\u2014we no longer could go home."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eblana... Where... are we going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Where do you want to go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nowhere's home, so go knock on any old door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just need to be honest to whoever opens it, and tell them that we have no home to go back to on this snowy, festive night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how cold they are, surely they'll sympathize with two children.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Loughshinny, don't be afraid. I'm watching over you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Under the glow of icy, purple flames, I knocked haltingly on the first door."
    },
    {
        "text": "The flames had taken the lives of those we hated so only moments ago, but I wondered so badly\u2014if those flames would come to kill me instead, if I did anything wrong."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
