    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But\u2014what did Sir do wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard\u2014there was a play being put on in the Tarans' neighborhood, hence why on such a snowy night, Sir never came home for being so late."
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister made me sit down in his study. She simply warmly stared at me, and never answered my questions straight."
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew\u2014she was very disappointed in me. I should have been able to reach my own answers."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...He taught us\u2014to ruin the lives of the innocent, to stir the schism between the Tarans and Victorians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "He even... plotted his fallen opponent's murder, just like\u2014those Victorians\u2014killed our parents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, taking his life... was what we were meant to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister could always do the right things, while I never could."
    },
    {
        "text": "She gifted her spear to me, yet every time I gripped it, that pike burning with flames, I shivered."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as I did now."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I... right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
