    },
    {
        "text": "He showered us in conspiracy and political trickery, peeled us of our freedom and dignity. That was detestable, yet detest is all that is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even while he'd mastered his methods, his sights were set too narrow. That's what was truly regrettable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wanted little more than the control of a brittle, fantasy nation, with us serving as the puppets that would crown him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The power I look to have in my hands is far grander than the daydreams of that madman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014What about you, Loughshinny? What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it's good that your blood and your upbringing have you carry yourself high, but if you want for nothing, then what sort of position am I meant to leave by my side for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on. This is your wish on a snowy night... I'll let you aspire as grand as you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "I only had the tiniest dream, like the warm fire of a hearth."
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't dare answer."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter, my sister. If you don't know where your own desires lie, then first become me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "From hereon, you and I are both 'The Leader'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
